# Tự động chuẩn hóa EOL sang LF cho text files
* text=auto eol=lf

# Documentation & Code
*.md text
*.json text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.py text
*.ps1 text

# Excel: NHI PHAN, KHONG dung Git LFS (Duc chot 03/09, quyet dinh D7).
# Vi sao bo LFS: template chi 44 KB — LFS khong giai quyet van de gi ma them mot tang
# co the gay CAM: ai clone ma khong cai git-lfs se nhan file con tro vai tram byte thay
# vi workbook, khong bao loi. Cai gia roi dung vao nguoi dung moi — doi tuong repo nham toi.
# Bat lai khi nao that su co workbook hang chuc MB.
# `binary` la BAT BUOC: dong `* text=auto eol=lf` o tren se coi .xlsx la text va lam HONG file.
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary